de from the pohutukawa trees"},{"kind":"audio","t":91076.684104,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91081.96401,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91084.956578,"samples":24464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"input","t":100610.105464,"text":"printre sporturile populare se numără fotbalul baschetul voleiul polo napă scrima rugby-ul"},{"kind":"text","t":101031.19855799999,"text":"Popular sports include football, basketball, volleyball, polo, sailing, fencing, and rugby"},{"kind":"audio","t":101069.290432,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101070.651923,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101072.13155199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101073.682831,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101074.655607,"samples":27928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":105622.868667,"text":"ciclismul hocheiul pe gheață hocheiul pe role și cursele de formula unu"},{"kind":"text","t":105969.441348,"text":"cycling, ice hockey, roller hockey, and Formula One racing"},{"kind":"audio","t":106027.764178,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106032.704289,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106038.063643,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":106039.289016,"samples":13296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":112313.79007199999,"text":"în climatul cald din orientul mijlociu casa era mai puțin importantă"},{"kind":"text","t":112726.38537599999,"text":"In the hot climate of the Middle East, the house was less important."},{"kind":"audio","t":112772.106693,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":112776.969545,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":112782.262611,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":112